       CBL INITCHECK
      * THE SAME PROGRAM AS ZE148N WITH Y INITIALIZED BEFORE THE IF
      * STATEMENT, IN A PERFORMED PARAGRAPH: NO WARNING (RETURN CODE 0).
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZE148P.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  Y PIC 9.
       01  Z PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM SET-Y.
           IF Y > 5
               MOVE 2 TO Z
           END-IF.
           STOP RUN.
       SET-Y.
           MOVE 7 TO Y.
       END PROGRAM ZE148P.
